   "final_message": "All 6 sweep points are clean \u2014 DRC 0, LVS match at every point.\n\n**Final status:** `/o21ai.icl` is complete and verified clean over the full sweep.\n\n**What was hard:** The main challenge was getting the diffusion island breaks and net labels right for this AOI21 structure. The key insight was that gate order A1-A2-B1 works for both rows, but the n-row needs an island break between A2 and B1 (since M5's drain=VGND can't share diffusion with M3's source=Y). This required a 0.80 gap between g2 and g3, with nd2 covering only g3. The p-row stays as a single island VPWR-A1-n1-A2-Y-B1-VPWR. Getting the contact net labels correct on both sides of each gate (especially the Y net appearing on both sides of g2 on the p-row, and n2 on both sides of g1 on the n-row) was critical for LVS to match.",
